This repository is published so that the hooks running on the XahauCards
accounts can be read and verified by anybody. It is source-available, not open
source.

WHAT YOU MAY DO

You may read this source. You may compile and run it for the purpose of
verifying that it produces the bytecode deployed on the Xahau ledger, and for
study, review and security research. You may quote from it when discussing or
reporting on it.

